OL,3,CRain and cooler conditions forecast
OL,4,Cafter fifth heatwave of the summer
OL,6,FFresher conditions are expected this
OL,7,Fweek, with rain and even thunderstorms
OL,8,Fpossible in some parts of the UK,
OL,9,Fafter weeks of hot and dry weather.
OL,11,FA Met Office meteorologist said that
OL,12,Fthe south of the UK will experience
OL,13,F"changeable" conditions with
OL,14,Ftemperatures turning "cooler".
OL,16,FDespite the forecast, a yellow heat
OL,17,Fhealth alert has been extended until
OL,18,F9am on Tuesday for the South East,
OL,19,FSouth West, and London.
OL,26,@uD@AOUuD@LO]vD@VOUvD@]O]
