OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786949274
OL,3,CRain and cooler conditions forecast
OL,4,Cafter fifth heatwave of the summer
OL,6,FThe UK recently experienced its fifth
OL,7,Fheatwave of the summer with the
OL,8,Fhottest day of the year recorded in
OL,9,FKew Gardens, London, on Thursday when
OL,10,Ftemperatures reached 38.1C.
OL,12,FIn a Sunday update, Met Office
OL,13,Fmeteorologist Tom Morgan said: "I
OL,14,Fcan't promise rain for all of us
OL,15,Fthrough the week ahead, but in the
OL,16,Fsouth at least, it's looking like the
OL,17,Fmost changeable week we've seen here `
OL,18,Fwell at least since the end of June."
OL,26,@uD@`OUzD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
