PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786949274
OL,3,CRain and cooler conditions forecast
OL,4,Cafter fifth heatwave of the summer
OL,6,FA jet stream which has been far in the
OL,7,Fnorth of the UK has allowed high
OL,8,Fpressure to dominate, causing the
OL,9,Frecent excessively hot conditions, Mr
OL,10,FMorgan said.
OL,12,FMr Morgan said it would travel south,
OL,13,Fmeaning that low pressure will
OL,14,Fdominate, adding: "So a much more
OL,15,Fchangeable and at times unsettled
OL,16,Foutlook through the middle part of the
OL,17,Fweek ` low pressure will dominate and
OL,18,Fslowly drift its way southwards."
OL,26,@vD@SOUzD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
