OL,3,CRain and cooler conditions forecast
OL,4,Cafter fifth heatwave of the summer
OL,6,FHe said it would start to turn
OL,7,F"cooler" as wind switches to a
OL,8,Fnortherly direction, adding: "So as
OL,9,Fwell as some rain, showers, and even
OL,10,Fthunderstorms in places, it will
OL,11,Fcertainly feel considerably fresher
OL,12,Fthan recent weeks in the south."
OL,14,FShowers are expected to become more
OL,15,Fwidespread on Thursday with a mix of
OL,16,Fsunshine and rain earlier in the week,
OL,17,Faccording to the Met Office.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@HO]pD@^OUtD@`O]
