OL,3,CRain and cooler conditions forecast
OL,4,Cafter fifth heatwave of the summer
OL,6,FWildfires have ravaged parts of the
OL,7,FUK, including in the West Midlands,
OL,8,Fwhere a blaze in Stourbridge destroyed
OL,9,F19 homes.
OL,11,FWest Midlands Fire Service said they
OL,12,Fhad been able to "significantly lift"
OL,13,Fcordons as households who were
OL,14,Fevacuated started returning to their
OL,15,Fhomes over the weekend.
OL,17,FSouth Wales Fire and Rescue Service
OL,18,Fresponded to "significant wildfire
OL,19,Factivity" on Sunday, with crews
OL,20,Fattending 14 wildfire incidents.
OL,26,@tD@ROUtD@eO]zD@NOU{D@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
