FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786949274
OL,3,CRain and cooler conditions forecast
OL,4,Cafter fifth heatwave of the summer
OL,6,FAbout 200 military personnel and crews
OL,7,Ffrom London, Greater Manchester,
OL,8,FCumbria and Bedfordshire have also
OL,9,Fbeen deployed to the region to assist.
OL,11,FOn Friday, millions of people in
OL,12,FEngland and Wales received an alert on
OL,13,Ftheir mobile devices warning them of a
OL,14,F"very high risk of wildfires
OL,15,Fnationally".
OL,17,FSeveral fire services have since
OL,18,Fuploaded statements asking people to
OL,19,Fonly call 999 to report a genuine
OL,20,Femergency.
OL,26,@vD@AOUwD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
