PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786949274
OL,3,CRain and cooler conditions forecast
OL,4,Cafter fifth heatwave of the summer
OL,6,FSouth Wales Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,Fsaid just before 7pm on Saturday that
OL,8,Fit was experiencing an "unprecedented
OL,9,Fdemand", having received 736 calls
OL,10,Fcompared with an average of about 300.
OL,12,FThe alert came after Prime Minister
OL,13,FAndy Burnham described Britain as a
OL,14,F"tinderbox" and a temporary ban on
OL,15,Fdisposable barbecues was put in place.
OL,17,FA 50-year-old man has been charged
OL,18,Fwith arson after several small fires
OL,19,Fwere set in Hackney, east London.
OL,26,@pD@XOUqD@GO]vD@AOUvD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
