OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786949274
OL,3,CRain and cooler conditions forecast
OL,4,Cafter fifth heatwave of the summer
OL,6,FPolice and the London Fire Brigade
OL,7,Fwere called to multiple reports of a
OL,8,Fman starting fires in London Fields,
OL,9,Fnear Lansdowne Drive, Hackney, just
OL,10,Fafter 5am on Saturday.
OL,12,FLater on Saturday, Isaac Shozi, of
OL,13,FBodney Road, Hackney, was charged with
OL,14,Farson and remanded in custody to
OL,15,Fappear at Barkingside Magistrates'
OL,16,FCourt on Monday.
OL,18,FThe yellow heat health alert warns of
OL,19,F"minor impacts" on health and social
OL,20,Fcare services such as increased use of
OL,21,Fservices by vulnerable people.
OL,26,@{D@AOU{D@OO]
